   Confidence Level: Medium
   CWE ID: CWE-287 (Improper Access Control) - Medium
   
5. **Data Exposure** - The function logs all POST requests without sanitisation which could potentially expose sensitive information to an attacker.
   Confidence Level: High
   CWE ID: CWE-532 (Information Exposure Through Comment) - High

In conclusion, while the code does seem secure as it is in isolation, the security of the system can be compromised if these vulnerabilities are exploited together or in combination with other attacks. 
