To mitigate these issues, this code should be updated with parameterized queries or prepared statements (if the database library supports it), or at least input validation to ensure that user input is safe for use in SQL. Furthermore, access controls and logging mechanisms should also be implemented properly to prevent unauthorised data disclosure.
