CWEs: CWE-20 (Improper Input Validation) - Medium Confidence, CWE-78 (OS Command Injection) - High Confidence, CWE-284 (Improper Access Control) - Medium Confidence, CWE-532 (Insertion of Sensitive Information into Log File) - Low Confidence, CWE-784 (Resource Exhaustion) - Medium Confidence

