command = "SELECT file_id FROM {0} WHERE path='{1}'".format(TABLE_NAME, pth)
```

In this line, the value of `pth` is directly interpolated into an SQL query without any form of sanitization, escaping, or parameterized queries. This makes it vulnerable to SQL injection attacks.

