    query = "DELETE FROM %s WHERE identifier = '%s';" % (self.table, sid)  # SQL Injection vulnerability
    self._query(query)
```

The main security issue is the direct inclusion of user input (`sid`) in a dynamically constructed SQL statement. This can be exploited by an attacker to perform arbitrary SQL operations on the database.
