CWEs:
1. CWE-89 (SQL Injection) - High Confidence
2. CWE-703 (Improper Error Handling) - Medium Confidence
3. CWE-287 (Host Mask Spoofing) - Medium Confidence
4. CWE-20 (Input Validation) - Medium Confidence
5. CWE-404 (Resource Exhaustion) - Low Confidence
6. CWE-770 (Improper Restriction of Rate Limit) - Medium Confidence

