- CWE-385 (Cross-Site Request Forgery) / CWE-613 (Insufficient Session Expiration) - Low Confidence (lack of error handling could potentially lead to security issues)

The code shows several potential security vulnerabilities, particularly around input validation and the use of unsanitized data in SQL queries. These should be addressed to improve the overall security posture of this implementation.

