     ) % {'url': request.path + '?tags=' + request.REQUEST['tags']}
     ```
     Here, the `request.REQUEST['tags']` is directly concatenated into an HTML string without any escaping. This can lead to XSS vulnerabilities if malicious scripts are included in the tags.
