   - The function logs information using `LOG.info` with the message format `'WWPN on node %(node)s: %(wwpn)s'`. If `self._storage_nodes[key]['id']` or `self._storage_nodes[key]['WWPN']` contains sensitive information (e.g., IP addresses, passwords), logging this could expose it to unauthorized access.
