CWEs: CWE-426 - Insecure File Check and Handling (Medium Confidence), CWE-20 - Insecure File Handling and Access Control (Medium Confidence), CWE-78 - Unvalidated User Input in Script Execution (Low Confidence), CWE-532 - Potential Information Disclosure via Logging (Low Confidence), CWE-415 - Outdated Library Advisory (php-fpm.ini) (High Confidence), CWE-22 - Unvalidated and Unsecured Directories (High Confidence)
</analysis>

