This function is vulnerable to **Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)** due to the potential injection of malicious HTML or JavaScript code through the `wwn` parameter. If an attacker were able to manipulate the value of `wwn` to include malicious code, they could execute arbitrary scripts on the system.

