   The `common._cli_run()` method may be vulnerable to cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks if it is used with untrusted input or if the output is not properly sanitized. However, since this function is intended for internal use within a storage management system and does not directly manipulate web pages, I assign low confidence to this finding.

